## Messages shown to Pacified players when they try to do violence:

# With projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw = 我下不了手扔出 { THE($projectile) }，那可能会伤到人！
# With embedding projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-embed = 我绝不能扔出 { THE($projectile) }，那可能会嵌进别人身体里！
# With liquid-spilling projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-spill = 我绝不能扔出 { THE($projectile) }，那可能会把恶心的东西洒到别人身上！
# With bolas and snares:
pacified-cannot-throw-snare = 我不能扔出 { THE($projectile) }，万一有人被绊倒怎么办？！

pacified-cannot-harm-directly = 我下不了手伤害 { THE($entity) }！
pacified-cannot-harm-indirect = 我不能破坏 { THE($entity) }，那可能会伤到人！
pacified-cannot-fire-gun = 我不能朝 { THE($entity) } 开火，那可能会伤到人！